# Uvagf · 17 · Xrrc gur ynfg 500 riragf

## Uvag 1

Qenj n ebj bs 3 obkrf ba cncre naq cynl gur ERNQZR rknzcyr bs n evat bs fvmr 3: 5 inyhrf, bar
`Nqq` ng n gvzr. Zbivat rirel inyhr 1 obk gb gur yrsg ba rnpu `Nqq` vf gur boivbhf vqrn, naq vg
pbfgf `fvmr` zbirf cre pnyy. Jung vs gur inyhrf fgnl jurer gurl ner, naq gur cynpr jurer lbh
jevgr zbirf vafgrnq? Nfx jung lbh zhfg erzrzore, orfvqrf gur obkrf, gb nafjre `Yra`, `Byqrfg` naq
`Arjrfg` nsgre nal ahzore bs pnyyf.

## Uvag 2

Nyybpngr gur fyvpr bapr jvgu `znxr([]G, fvmr)`. Xrrc gur vaqrk bs gur obk gur arkg `Nqq` jevgrf,
naq gur ahzore bs inyhrf uryq. Gur jevgr vaqrk zbirf 1 fgrc cre `Nqq` naq whzcf onpx gb 0 nsgre
gur ynfg obk: gung vf gur erznvaqre `%`. Gur byqrfg inyhr fvgf "pbhag" obkrf oruvaq gur jevgr
vaqrk, naq urer vf gur znva cvgsnyy: va Tb, `%` xrrcf gur fvta bs gur yrsg bcrenaq, fb `-1 % 3` vf
`-1`, abg `2`. Nqq `fvmr` orsber lbh gnxr gur erznvaqre. Gur frpbaq cvgsnyy vf va `Ynfg`: n
fhofyvpr bs lbhe ohssre, fhpu nf `ohs[n:o]`, vf n jvaqbj vagb gur evat, abg n pbcl. Gur arkg `Nqq`
punatrf jung gur pnyyre ubyqf, naq na `nccraq` ol gur pnyyre jevgrf vagb lbhe rzcgl obkrf. Sbe
`Erpbeqre`, fgber cbvagref va gur znc: jvgu `Evat` inyhrf, `z[xrl].Nqq(i)` qbrf abg pbzcvyr.

## Uvag 3

1. Svryqf bs `Evat`: gur ohssre, gur jevgr vaqrk, gur pbhag, naq gur ahzore qebccrq.
2. `ArjEvat`: cnavp jvgu n zrffntr gung pbagnvaf gur onq fvmr vs vg vf orybj 1. Bgurejvfr znxr
   gur ohssre jvgu yratgu `fvmr`.
3. `Nqq`: jevgr ng gur jevgr vaqrk, gura zbir gur jevgr vaqrk 1 fgrc, jenccvat jvgu `%`. Vs gur
   pbhag vf orybj gur fvmr, vapernfr gur pbhag; bgurejvfr gur jevgr ercynprq gur byqrfg inyhr, fb
   vapernfr gur qebccrq pbhagre.
4. N fznyy urycre "jurer vf gur v-gu byqrfg inyhr?": gur jevgr vaqrk zvahf gur pbhag cyhf `v`,
   cyhf gur fvmr, nyy zbqhyb gur fvmr. Purpx vg ba cncre sbe na rzcgl evat, n shyy evat naq n
   jenccrq evat.
5. `Byqrfg` naq `Arjrfg`: ba pbhag 0, qrpyner n inevnoyr bs glcr `G` naq erghea vg jvgu `snyfr`.
   Bgurejvfr ernq gur urycre'f cbfvgvba 0 be pbhag - 1.
6. `Ynfg(a)`: phg `a` qbja gb gur pbhag. Vs vg vf 0 be yrff, erghea avy. Znxr n arj fyvpr bs gung
   yratgu naq svyy vg sebz gur urycre'f cbfvgvba pbhag - a bajneqf, rvgure inyhr ol inyhr be jvgu
   2 pnyyf gb `pbcl`: bar hc gb gur raq bs gur ohssre, bar sebz vgf fgneg.
7. `Erpbeqre`: gur fvmr naq n znc sebz xrl gb `*Evat[G]`. `Nqq` ybbxf gur xrl hc naq perngrf n
   evat vs vg vf zvffvat. `Qhzc` ergheaf avy sbe n zvffvat xrl, bgurejvfr nyy inyhrf bs vgf evat.
   `Sbetrg` ybbxf gur xrl hc gb xabj gur nafjre, gura qryrgrf vg. `Yra` vf gur yratgu bs gur znc.
